WEBVTT

01:40.100 --> 01:43.009
[Fangs of Fortune]

01:43.120 --> 01:46.020
[Episode 28]

01:46.090 --> 01:48.590
Princess Longyu has a bad temper

01:48.710 --> 01:50.740
and hates to see people,

01:50.910 --> 01:52.539
especially men.

01:52.700 --> 01:54.430
So, we had to let Zhuo and the others

01:54.430 --> 01:56.229
stay in the White Emperor Tower.

01:57.120 --> 01:58.590
Am I not a man?

01:58.950 --> 02:00.450
You're an ape.

02:02.160 --> 02:03.550
Whenever you need me,

02:03.840 --> 02:05.940
I'll come to your aid.

02:10.310 --> 02:11.110
Well,

02:11.970 --> 02:14.300
I wanted to eavesdrop on Princess Longyu,

02:14.390 --> 02:16.450
so I cast a spell on Mr. Zhuo and the others

02:16.450 --> 02:17.570
to carry voices

02:17.829 --> 02:19.200
to their ears.

02:20.140 --> 02:21.290
But now,

02:21.590 --> 02:23.640
they heard our words of love.

02:24.440 --> 02:25.900
It's embarrassing.

02:27.590 --> 02:29.480
Shame on you, Zhao Yuanzhou.

02:29.550 --> 02:30.520
Bastard!

02:31.990 --> 02:33.440
He's talking nonsense!

02:33.760 --> 02:34.890
Huh.

02:35.270 --> 02:36.150
Mr. Zhuo,

02:36.310 --> 02:37.670
after you became a demon,

02:37.670 --> 02:40.300
your voice turned more sonorous when cursing.

02:43.040 --> 02:44.640
But you'd better be careful.

02:44.870 --> 02:45.390
It seems

02:45.410 --> 02:47.050
your ice marks

02:47.150 --> 02:48.210
are about to crack.

02:52.110 --> 02:53.550
If Jiu were here

02:53.950 --> 02:55.570
and saw the powerful great demon

02:55.570 --> 02:57.090
Mr. Zhuo has become,

02:57.790 --> 02:59.630
he'd scream with delight.

03:00.990 --> 03:02.920
Jiu is most afraid of great demons.

03:03.550 --> 03:04.670
I think he'd scream

03:04.670 --> 03:05.400
with terror.

03:10.070 --> 03:11.730
What are we having for dinner?

03:11.870 --> 03:13.000
Sweet and sour ribs?

03:14.510 --> 03:15.440
What do you mean?

03:15.750 --> 03:16.980
Then why didn't you

03:17.470 --> 03:19.310
buy sugar and ribs?

03:22.950 --> 03:23.590
What?

03:27.670 --> 03:29.520
The ingredients are hard to get in the Wilderness.

03:29.520 --> 03:32.120
I'll make it when we return to the mortal world.

03:33.270 --> 03:34.120
She's coming.

03:52.090 --> 03:53.329
Baize Goddess.

03:55.360 --> 03:56.620
Are you Zhu Yan?

03:57.510 --> 03:58.430
See?

03:58.829 --> 03:59.790
I told you

04:00.080 --> 04:02.140
everyone in the Wilderness knows me.

04:02.740 --> 04:04.670
The notorious Zhu Yan.

04:07.220 --> 04:09.750
Next time, please finish your words in one go.

04:11.670 --> 04:13.910
Baize Goddess, why did you free me

04:14.170 --> 04:16.089
and summon me here?

04:16.970 --> 04:18.100
I want

04:19.800 --> 04:21.399
to ask you for a dragon scale.

04:23.830 --> 04:25.040
Interesting.

04:25.870 --> 04:28.940
Why are there so many people who want my dragon scale today?

04:28.940 --> 04:31.740
Someone else asked you for your dragon scale, too?

04:31.940 --> 04:33.270
If you don't want to die,

04:33.310 --> 04:34.970
give me your dragon scale.

04:38.030 --> 04:39.430
A dragon has a reverse scale,

04:39.430 --> 04:40.990
which you can't touch.

04:41.350 --> 04:43.470
If you touch it, the dragon will get angry.

04:43.470 --> 04:45.330
Neither can you snatch the scale.

04:45.630 --> 04:48.110
If you do, its spiritual energy will disappear.

04:48.110 --> 04:50.310
Only if the dragon gives you the scale willingly

04:50.310 --> 04:52.200
can it resurrect everything.

04:53.750 --> 04:55.860
You don't even know that?

05:02.670 --> 05:03.480
Oh.

05:05.430 --> 05:06.690
There's someone else.

05:12.400 --> 05:13.800
Princess Longyu.

05:14.190 --> 05:15.380
Your old friend

05:15.400 --> 05:17.240
asked me to send you a letter.

05:31.920 --> 05:33.460
[Meng Xuan]

05:34.360 --> 05:35.150
Meng Xuan.

05:37.470 --> 05:41.970
[To Long Yu] [Meng Xuan]

05:46.210 --> 05:49.640
[Meng Xuan]

05:50.230 --> 05:52.430
There's nothing to expect of this love.

05:52.590 --> 05:54.590
Although I regret it, it's too late.

05:55.620 --> 05:56.720
Meng Xuan.

06:01.480 --> 06:02.740
Where did you get this?

06:03.140 --> 06:04.340
You want to know?

06:05.990 --> 06:08.590
Give me Zhu Yan's inner core, and I'll tell you.

06:22.110 --> 06:23.910
Why do you want the dragon scale?

06:24.710 --> 06:25.960
I'm poisoned.

06:27.310 --> 06:28.450
I want to detoxify.

06:29.430 --> 06:30.470
Poisoned?

06:32.030 --> 06:34.880
The goddess is really good at making up stories.

06:35.560 --> 06:38.370
Besides books about demons, there must also be many novels

06:38.370 --> 06:40.120
in the Archives.

06:40.710 --> 06:42.040
She must have read a lot.

06:42.490 --> 06:43.390
Novels?

06:44.740 --> 06:45.380
When I was young,

06:45.380 --> 06:47.390
my grandfather didn't allow me to read novels,

06:47.390 --> 06:49.320
calling them a breach of morality.

06:50.170 --> 06:51.900
I don't quite understand that.

06:52.220 --> 06:53.270
The novels Wen Xiao read

06:53.270 --> 06:54.830
are not the same

06:55.409 --> 06:57.730
as the novels your grandfather mentioned.

06:57.730 --> 06:59.090
I want the dragon scale

06:59.240 --> 07:00.470
just to live

07:02.000 --> 07:03.360
so that I can stay with him

07:03.360 --> 07:04.600
forever.

07:08.080 --> 07:09.240
Am I right?

07:11.180 --> 07:12.210
Of course.

07:13.450 --> 07:15.020
They say

07:15.310 --> 07:17.240
people who love each other don't always

07:17.240 --> 07:19.250
get together and live happily ever after.

07:19.250 --> 07:20.480
They don't know

07:20.910 --> 07:22.810
there are faithful lovers

07:22.990 --> 07:25.920
who are willing to give up everything for each other.

07:30.380 --> 07:31.420
That's us.

07:32.760 --> 07:34.340
Faithful lovers?

07:35.150 --> 07:37.430
When a human and a demon fall in love with each other,

07:37.430 --> 07:39.390
it's destined to be a tragedy.

07:40.460 --> 07:42.760
You owe me the dragon scale.

07:44.070 --> 07:45.470
You owe me a life.

07:46.850 --> 07:47.980
Have you forgotten?

07:49.100 --> 07:50.120
No, I haven't.

07:51.040 --> 07:53.920
I'm willing to hold your hands

07:54.510 --> 07:57.340
and spend the rest of my life with you.

07:58.030 --> 07:59.200
Meng Xuan.

08:06.790 --> 08:09.250
These are the Feng Pearl and the Huang Pearl,

08:09.630 --> 08:11.690
secret treasures of the Longyu Clan.

08:12.550 --> 08:13.620
Now,

08:13.950 --> 08:16.220
I'm giving the Feng Pearl to you.

08:17.910 --> 08:20.910
Feng and Huang are two birds that are always together.

08:21.230 --> 08:22.920
If you don't deceive me,

08:23.230 --> 08:25.230
I'll be with you in life and in death.

08:32.400 --> 08:33.429
Darling.

08:34.309 --> 08:35.700
Don't bother.

08:37.030 --> 08:38.710
I was bitten by the Black Bee.

08:40.110 --> 08:41.510
Herbs in the mortal world

08:42.070 --> 08:43.470
can't cure me.

08:46.270 --> 08:47.270
You will be cured.

08:49.590 --> 08:51.550
I asked Princess Longyu for help.

08:52.730 --> 08:55.380
The reverse scale on the back of her neck can cure all diseases

08:55.380 --> 08:57.170
and bring the dead back to life.

09:01.390 --> 09:02.550
You and the baby

09:03.590 --> 09:04.920
will be fine.

09:06.250 --> 09:07.640
Drink the medicine.

09:16.560 --> 09:18.990
I asked Princess Longyu for help.

09:19.800 --> 09:22.430
The reverse scale on the back of her neck can cure all diseases

09:22.430 --> 09:24.260
and bring the dead back to life.

09:24.850 --> 09:26.660
But he didn't know

09:26.910 --> 09:28.000
every creature in the river

09:28.000 --> 09:29.710
could talk to me.

09:30.720 --> 09:32.620
He lied to me.

09:33.000 --> 09:35.740
He just wanted to save his wife and child.

09:36.750 --> 09:37.830
I hated him.

09:40.910 --> 09:44.300
I was jealous of the woman he had been protecting.

09:45.690 --> 09:47.680
So, I wanted to kill them.

09:52.070 --> 09:53.110
Senior.

09:57.490 --> 09:58.620
Meng Xuan.

09:58.790 --> 09:59.190
Yes.

10:01.440 --> 10:02.310
Well...

10:04.550 --> 10:06.150
Take the medicine

10:06.540 --> 10:08.120
to my home and give it to my wife.

10:08.120 --> 10:08.890
Okay.

10:09.030 --> 10:10.710
I have to go out of town now.

10:11.040 --> 10:11.530
Okay.

10:11.560 --> 10:12.290
Don't worry.

10:12.300 --> 10:13.430
I'll go now.

10:13.460 --> 10:14.110
Okay.

10:14.390 --> 10:16.880
But I couldn't bear to kill Meng Xuan.

10:18.470 --> 10:21.150
So, I asked him to meet me outside of town

10:22.550 --> 10:24.330
so he wouldn't be home.

10:25.140 --> 10:27.830
Unexpectedly, he didn't come.

10:28.260 --> 10:29.570
Wen He.

10:29.780 --> 10:30.570
Meng.

10:30.820 --> 10:31.660
Where is Wen Xiao?

10:31.660 --> 10:32.830
I haven't seen her for a long time.

10:32.830 --> 10:34.290
She's grown taller, right?

10:34.290 --> 10:36.400
I heard my senior's wife has lost her appetite recently.

10:36.400 --> 10:38.000
I brought her some plums.

10:38.350 --> 10:39.680
Something smells good.

10:40.460 --> 10:41.390
What is it?

10:42.400 --> 10:43.190
Mrs...

10:44.870 --> 10:45.870
Wen,

10:45.900 --> 10:47.030
it has been...

10:47.150 --> 10:48.390
Wen! Wen!

10:50.510 --> 10:51.360
Guards.

10:51.400 --> 10:52.170
Guards!

11:01.970 --> 11:03.630
I secretly put some Bone-Melting Incense,

11:03.630 --> 11:06.150
a unique poison of our clan,

11:06.630 --> 11:08.210
in Meng Xuan's house.

11:08.730 --> 11:10.160
Bone-Melting Incense?

11:11.110 --> 11:12.550
It's a diffusive poison

11:12.550 --> 11:14.210
made from red mermaid pearls.

11:14.790 --> 11:17.450
Anyone who smells it rots and dies immediately.

11:18.850 --> 11:22.450
It's strictly forbidden to take this poison to the mortal world.

11:23.350 --> 11:26.150
I only wanted to kill his wife and child.

11:28.200 --> 11:30.590
I didn't expect Meng Xuan would stand me up

11:32.470 --> 11:34.330
and go home early.

11:34.870 --> 11:37.740
Maybe God thought he was hateful, too.

11:38.350 --> 11:40.200
He deserved it.

11:41.540 --> 11:42.690
Is there a saying

11:42.780 --> 11:44.440
in the mortal world that goes,

11:44.540 --> 11:45.630
"An innocent person's only crime

11:45.630 --> 11:47.360
is to own something valuable"?

11:48.710 --> 11:49.940
Princess Longyu

11:50.670 --> 11:52.630
may never be able to tell

11:53.510 --> 11:54.670
if her admirers

11:55.510 --> 11:57.240
come for her

11:58.260 --> 12:00.140
or for her dragon scale.

12:02.300 --> 12:03.660
People with a treasure

12:04.530 --> 12:06.510
are always surrounded by bad wolves

12:06.510 --> 12:07.970
and cunning foxes.

12:09.090 --> 12:10.310
In most cases,

12:10.330 --> 12:12.190
in order to protect the treasure,

12:12.610 --> 12:15.050
they become a bloodthirsty beast, too.

12:19.250 --> 12:20.710
It's a choice.

12:22.190 --> 12:23.520
She could choose not to.

12:26.110 --> 12:27.160
No matter what,

12:28.430 --> 12:29.740
sharp teeth and claws

12:30.410 --> 12:32.810
can't be used to hurt the innocent and weak.

12:35.710 --> 12:37.140
Meng Xuan was hateful.

12:38.330 --> 12:39.860
But you deserve death, too.

12:42.160 --> 12:44.200
Meng Xuan's wife was pregnant.

12:44.230 --> 12:45.760
How could you do that?

12:47.260 --> 12:50.010
You also killed my father.

13:37.320 --> 13:39.540
I was guided here by the short flute.

13:40.870 --> 13:42.760
I'm glad I found you.

13:48.350 --> 13:49.310
I'll pay you back

13:49.940 --> 13:51.360
what I owe you.

13:53.270 --> 13:54.950
But I have a request.

13:55.890 --> 13:56.990
What is it?

13:57.510 --> 13:58.750
If you want my scale,

14:00.730 --> 14:02.710
give me his inner core.

14:48.850 --> 14:49.640
Wen Xiao.

14:53.400 --> 14:54.570
I thought

14:55.030 --> 14:57.400
I could use Princess Longyu's guilt for me

14:58.150 --> 15:00.280
to make her hand over her dragon scale.

15:00.820 --> 15:01.350
Wen Xiao.

15:01.350 --> 15:02.760
But I didn't expect that...

15:02.760 --> 15:04.020
Don't blame yourself.

15:04.840 --> 15:07.440
Not everyone is as kind as you.

15:08.580 --> 15:10.240
Don't let others' wickedness

15:10.320 --> 15:11.910
change your kindness.

15:15.130 --> 15:15.930
Hey.

15:16.630 --> 15:17.930
Don't you think

15:17.950 --> 15:19.770
you look too grim?

15:20.100 --> 15:23.120
It may make others think the Wilderness is going to collapse again.

15:23.120 --> 15:25.100
The Wilderness is not going to collapse.

15:25.100 --> 15:26.260
You are.

15:26.290 --> 15:28.350
I can't believe you're still joking.

15:30.470 --> 15:32.020
Handing over Zhao Yuanzhou's inner core is not an option.

15:32.020 --> 15:33.350
Let's find another way.

15:52.950 --> 15:53.470
Zhao Yuanzhou.

15:53.470 --> 15:54.470
Why is it not an option?

15:54.470 --> 15:55.890
If you hand over my inner core,

15:55.890 --> 15:57.420
you can get the dragon scale

15:57.460 --> 15:59.320
to repair your Cloud Light Sword.

16:04.300 --> 16:05.470
Zhao Yuanzhou.

16:05.830 --> 16:07.130
What you said

16:07.200 --> 16:08.960
insulted Zhuo.

16:09.440 --> 16:10.630
Zhao Yuanzhou,

16:11.020 --> 16:12.210
keep

16:12.840 --> 16:14.200
your inner core.

16:15.260 --> 16:16.570
I won't exchange it

16:16.590 --> 16:18.170
for anything,

16:19.060 --> 16:20.790
not even the Cloud Light Sword.

16:34.760 --> 16:36.310
It's useless to look at them.

16:36.310 --> 16:37.560
The sword is mine.

16:37.720 --> 16:38.750
I have the final say.

16:38.750 --> 16:40.210
But the inner core is mine.

16:40.770 --> 16:42.110
I have the final say.

16:42.930 --> 16:43.890
Zhao Yuanzhou,

16:43.960 --> 16:44.870
don't push me.

16:45.070 --> 16:46.230
I'm not.

16:48.120 --> 16:49.230
I just don't want you

16:49.230 --> 16:51.150
to face this hard choice.

16:52.230 --> 16:53.960
So, I'm going to choose for you.

16:55.310 --> 16:56.770
And it seems

16:57.620 --> 16:59.000
Pei Sijing and Ying Lei

16:59.470 --> 17:01.070
agree with me.

17:04.800 --> 17:06.589
I know you want to save Jiu,

17:06.910 --> 17:08.970
but Zhao Yuanzhou is also our friend.

17:09.470 --> 17:10.140
Can you say

17:11.310 --> 17:12.960
one friend is more important than another?

17:12.960 --> 17:13.849
Why not?

17:14.109 --> 17:15.040
You're a coward,

17:15.310 --> 17:16.750
and you want to treat them fairly,

17:16.750 --> 17:18.640
but that doesn't mean everyone's like you.

17:18.640 --> 17:20.150
If you don't dare to choose,

17:20.150 --> 17:20.950
I dare!

17:21.470 --> 17:22.730
Jiu is more important!

17:26.619 --> 17:28.440
If everyone were fine today,

17:28.460 --> 17:30.260
I wouldn't force Zhao Yuanzhou.

17:30.620 --> 17:31.310
If

17:31.310 --> 17:32.870
Princess Longyu wanted my inner core,

17:32.870 --> 17:34.600
I'd give it to her immediately.

17:35.510 --> 17:36.750
But today,

17:36.920 --> 17:39.120
if either Jiu or Zhao Yuanzhou must die,

17:39.220 --> 17:40.770
I'll choose Zhao Yuanzhou

17:41.150 --> 17:42.350
without hesitation.

17:46.670 --> 17:47.680
Ying Lei.

17:48.680 --> 17:49.720
Every one of you

17:49.750 --> 17:50.990
is saying

17:51.160 --> 17:52.330
pretty words.

17:52.770 --> 17:54.230
Don't you want

17:54.250 --> 17:55.600
to be favored

17:55.860 --> 17:57.230
and be chosen firmly?

17:57.230 --> 17:59.680
Do you think Zhao Yuanzhou doesn't want to be favored

17:59.680 --> 18:01.540
and be chosen firmly?

18:02.920 --> 18:04.510
He

18:05.460 --> 18:07.870
has never been chosen firmly.

18:10.800 --> 18:11.930
Oh, that's not true.

18:12.690 --> 18:13.570
He has.

18:15.600 --> 18:17.550
Malicious energy chose him,

18:18.380 --> 18:20.370
and then everyone gave up on him.

18:26.400 --> 18:27.260
Mr. Zhuo,

18:28.330 --> 18:30.200
don't you want to save Jiu?

18:30.210 --> 18:32.400
He's being kept in that dark place.

18:34.480 --> 18:35.860
He must be scared.

18:38.220 --> 18:39.870
Every time he's most scared,

18:42.040 --> 18:43.320
you are the one

18:44.310 --> 18:45.470
he wants to turn to!

18:51.350 --> 18:52.190
Mr. Zhuo,

18:54.250 --> 18:55.420
Jiu needs you.

19:00.440 --> 19:01.680
No matter what,

19:03.520 --> 19:05.490
I'm on Zhuo's side.

19:07.710 --> 19:08.830
We don't agree

19:08.850 --> 19:11.710
to sacrifice Zhao Yuanzhou to get the dragon scale.

19:12.210 --> 19:13.350
It's not "we."

19:14.230 --> 19:15.890
It's only you and Zhuo Yichen.

19:27.200 --> 19:28.500
I thought

19:32.360 --> 19:34.200
we were like-minded.

19:36.500 --> 19:38.190
I was wrong.

19:40.040 --> 19:41.200
Today,

19:43.560 --> 19:46.420
anyone who wants to take Zhao Yuanzhou's inner core

19:48.750 --> 19:50.930
has to defeat me first.

19:59.070 --> 20:00.150
Don't bother.

20:00.720 --> 20:02.180
Don't use violence.

20:02.760 --> 20:04.220
I'll take out my inner core

20:06.130 --> 20:07.610
myself.

20:15.910 --> 20:16.750
Great Demon,

20:16.770 --> 20:17.570
no!

20:18.440 --> 20:19.600
Zhao Yuanzhou!

21:14.690 --> 21:16.820
I brought Zhao Yuanzhou's inner core.

21:17.950 --> 21:19.080
Where is the letter?

21:21.760 --> 21:22.980
[To Long Yu]

21:26.750 --> 21:31.540
[To Long Yu]

21:56.870 --> 21:58.210
This letter doesn't mean anything

21:58.210 --> 21:59.850
to me now.

22:20.920 --> 22:22.800
I knew you were still alive.

22:29.090 --> 22:31.520
That day, I did go to the forest

22:31.740 --> 22:32.970
as I promised.

22:34.810 --> 22:36.590
The man who rotted and died

22:37.500 --> 22:39.730
after smelling your Bone-Melting Incense

22:39.730 --> 22:40.840
was not me

22:41.230 --> 22:42.890
but my junior.

22:43.830 --> 22:46.000
He was the real Meng Xuan.

22:47.710 --> 22:48.430
Now that I think about it,

22:48.430 --> 22:50.190
I did have feelings for you.

22:52.080 --> 22:54.280
My feelings for you saved me

22:56.190 --> 22:58.790
but caused the death of my loved one.

23:27.290 --> 23:28.660
When you tried to get my dragon scale

23:28.660 --> 23:30.060
by deceiving me,

23:30.090 --> 23:32.290
did you ever think there would be karma?

23:33.800 --> 23:34.640
Karma?

23:36.560 --> 23:38.700
God is on my side.

23:40.270 --> 23:40.950
After so many years,

23:40.950 --> 23:43.470
you came to me again.

23:45.640 --> 23:47.690
Since you're here, I want you dead.

23:49.030 --> 23:50.970
I've been planning for so many years,

23:50.970 --> 23:52.850
waiting for this day to come

23:55.350 --> 23:56.350
to avenge my wife

23:57.110 --> 23:59.270
and my unborn child!

24:04.440 --> 24:05.110
[Respected by Generations]

24:16.640 --> 24:19.100
That was Pei Sijing's Shadow Hunting Arrow.

24:25.560 --> 24:26.670
It seems you're cooperating

24:26.670 --> 24:28.790
with the Demon Hunting Bureau.

24:40.770 --> 24:42.470
[There are fish in the water]

24:44.900 --> 24:50.270
[Princess Longyu can communicate with all creatures in the water]

24:50.400 --> 24:53.250
[One-Word Spell: act]

24:59.550 --> 25:00.570
Zhao Yuanzhou.

25:01.310 --> 25:02.570
Why is it not an option?

25:03.200 --> 25:04.860
If you hand over my inner core,

25:05.020 --> 25:06.620
you can get the dragon scale.

25:12.060 --> 25:14.260
Are you sure Princess Longyu is coming?

25:15.030 --> 25:17.190
I left some spies at the Chongwu Camp.

25:17.510 --> 25:19.570
The information should be accurate.

25:20.700 --> 25:21.880
What about you?

25:22.010 --> 25:24.640
Are you sure the fake inner core you gave her

25:24.660 --> 25:26.230
can fool Wen Zongyu?

25:26.590 --> 25:28.990
Wen Zongyu is always sinister and cunning.

25:29.600 --> 25:31.860
I hope his strong desire for my inner core

25:31.870 --> 25:33.540
will make him lower his guard.

25:37.030 --> 25:39.090
It seems we're okay now,

25:40.230 --> 25:41.030
but

25:41.050 --> 25:43.020
I don't think he is.

25:51.030 --> 25:51.950
Leave it to me.

25:53.080 --> 25:53.790
Zhuo.

25:53.790 --> 25:54.390
Go away.

25:54.390 --> 25:55.110
Okay.

26:04.980 --> 26:06.610
If I were Mr. Zhuo,

26:06.720 --> 26:08.450
I would be furious.

26:08.610 --> 26:10.550
Most importantly, Mr. Zhuo

26:10.580 --> 26:11.790
is usually serious.

26:11.820 --> 26:13.870
We all acted dramatically.

26:13.910 --> 26:15.920
Only he showed his true feelings.

26:15.940 --> 26:17.610
It was so embarrassing.

26:17.650 --> 26:18.770
Today,

26:19.710 --> 26:22.570
anyone who wants to take Zhao Yuanzhou's inner core

26:23.710 --> 26:25.820
has to defeat me first.

26:30.750 --> 26:33.210
The thing is, Zhuo was in the wrong position.

26:33.210 --> 26:34.450
If he had seen it,

26:34.470 --> 26:36.110
the fish in the water would have seen it, too.

26:36.110 --> 26:38.190
It has nothing to do with his position.

26:38.190 --> 26:39.710
Mr. Zhuo is upright

26:39.710 --> 26:41.070
and honest.

26:41.190 --> 26:42.610
Usually, when he's asked to lie,

26:42.610 --> 26:44.820
his ears turn extremely red.

26:44.920 --> 26:46.270
If we had made him lie,

26:46.550 --> 26:47.650
the fish in the water would have laughed so hard

26:47.650 --> 26:49.420
that they'd have turned upside-down.

26:49.420 --> 26:50.310
So funny.

27:03.470 --> 27:04.270
She's coming.

27:10.550 --> 27:13.660
I've applied a poison of our clan to the inner core.

27:16.100 --> 27:18.330
You're going to die soon.

27:19.930 --> 27:22.270
Don't you miss your wife and child?

27:23.910 --> 27:26.060
Go to hell and keep them company.

27:26.960 --> 27:29.120
I'm going with you.

27:39.320 --> 27:41.330
So, now you know

27:41.810 --> 27:47.090
[Carry on the Legacy]

27:42.450 --> 27:45.550
why I asked you to meet me here, right?

27:54.110 --> 27:56.360
You gave them your reverse scale?

27:57.270 --> 27:58.070
Yes.

27:59.960 --> 28:02.380
But Wen Xiao doesn't know

28:02.710 --> 28:04.710
that for us of the Longyu Clan, once we hand over our reverse scales,

28:04.710 --> 28:05.750
we die.

28:06.830 --> 28:08.840
Yet you know it.

28:09.590 --> 28:10.630
I loved you

28:10.630 --> 28:11.990
and trusted you,

28:12.110 --> 28:14.630
so I told you all my secrets.

28:15.020 --> 28:16.170
But what about you?

28:17.590 --> 28:19.450
The one who deserves to die is you,

28:20.510 --> 28:21.840
Meng Xuan.

28:24.550 --> 28:26.450
You're still calling me by the wrong name.

28:26.450 --> 28:28.310
Don't you think you're pathetic?

29:13.250 --> 29:15.040
I knew you'd play a trick,

29:15.350 --> 29:17.260
so I got prepared.

29:17.720 --> 29:19.900
You didn't let me down.

29:21.080 --> 29:26.140
[Carry on the Legacy]

29:25.280 --> 29:26.350
Meng Xuan!

29:26.350 --> 29:27.610
I'm not Meng Xuan!

29:30.260 --> 29:31.140
It's you.

29:32.620 --> 29:34.430
You killed my wife

29:34.700 --> 29:36.980
and my unborn child.

29:37.270 --> 29:39.130
It's all you demons' fault.

29:39.620 --> 29:41.020
But don't worry.

29:42.810 --> 29:44.940
I'll make all demons in the Wilderness

29:44.950 --> 29:46.190
die with you.

30:02.130 --> 30:03.390
Shall we let him go?

30:04.500 --> 30:06.740
There are about a dozen demonized humans in the yard.

30:06.740 --> 30:09.320
My One-Word Spells won't work on them.

30:09.550 --> 30:11.810
Your Cloud Light Sword hasn't been repaired.

30:11.810 --> 30:13.210
If we fight with them directly,

30:13.210 --> 30:14.740
we'll be at a disadvantage.

30:15.350 --> 30:16.980
Let's not alert them

30:17.230 --> 30:19.400
and see what Wen Zongyu wants to do.

30:31.010 --> 30:31.830
Miss,

30:31.830 --> 30:33.430
I'm in a rush to see a patient.

30:33.630 --> 30:34.390
Sorry.

30:35.710 --> 30:36.920
I'm Long…

30:37.470 --> 30:38.510
Long Yu.

30:38.590 --> 30:40.300
What's your name?

30:41.240 --> 30:42.210
Meng Xuan.

31:22.580 --> 31:27.280
[The Bloodline is Carried On]

31:50.630 --> 31:51.750
Goddess,

31:52.590 --> 31:53.850
what are you thinking?

31:54.750 --> 31:57.750
I'm thinking about how to repair the Cloud Light Sword

31:58.030 --> 31:59.480
to keep Zhuo alive

32:00.150 --> 32:01.690
and how to defeat Li Lun

32:02.780 --> 32:04.350
to keep Bai Jiu alive.

32:04.990 --> 32:05.940
What about me?

32:07.910 --> 32:09.570
You're not thinking about me?

32:10.650 --> 32:12.250
I'm also thinking about you.

32:12.950 --> 32:15.550
Since I met you, an evil great demon,

32:16.460 --> 32:17.920
I've learned more.

32:18.610 --> 32:20.750
What can you learn from me?

32:21.550 --> 32:23.610
Being pessimistic and world-weary?

32:27.030 --> 32:29.660
People can't choose their origins,

32:31.110 --> 32:33.950
but they can choose their own lives.

32:32.320 --> 32:36.650
♫You wear candlelight like a robe, awaiting dawn♫

32:36.910 --> 32:38.210
You and Li Lun

32:36.930 --> 32:41.210
♫While I cradle heartache, year after year, on and on♫

32:38.470 --> 32:41.520
saw Wen Zongyu kill little demons cruelly with your own eyes.

32:41.520 --> 32:43.130
♫In dreams, my hometown♫

32:43.190 --> 32:44.160
♫Lies under frost♫

32:43.490 --> 32:45.780
Li Lun chose to kill everyone

32:44.200 --> 32:47.750
♫All sounds♫

32:46.350 --> 32:48.050
not from his race.

32:48.380 --> 32:50.290
♫Are lost♫

32:48.660 --> 32:49.860
You, on the contrary,

32:50.550 --> 32:55.390
♫The wind brushes against rivers and hills♫

32:51.150 --> 32:54.080
are willing to believe that people are innately good

32:54.530 --> 32:55.980
and that all living beings

32:55.430 --> 32:59.260
♫Wild blooms refuse to fall♫

32:57.260 --> 32:59.680
deserve to be protected and cherished.

32:59.330 --> 33:04.430
♫They've seen every hue the world has borne♫

33:02.200 --> 33:04.260
Although we have different origins,

33:04.530 --> 33:08.450
♫Which blossom is meant for me?♫

33:05.640 --> 33:07.640
we ended up at the same destination.

33:08.940 --> 33:13.500
♫As songs are sung, how many truly understand?♫

33:11.630 --> 33:12.430
Good.

33:13.850 --> 33:17.430
♫The varied regrets we sing repeatedly♫

33:16.070 --> 33:17.980
Actually, all of us

33:17.820 --> 33:20.600
♫Have echoed for years♫

33:18.670 --> 33:20.690
are walking on the same ground,

33:20.840 --> 33:25.550
♫Hoping fate will amend♫

33:21.330 --> 33:23.390
which is called destiny.

33:24.590 --> 33:26.540
Life is like drifting fallen leaves,

33:25.980 --> 33:29.950
♫Remember me, a humble♫

33:28.570 --> 33:30.730
blown together by winds from all directions,

33:30.500 --> 33:32.510
♫Blossom♫

33:32.400 --> 33:33.430
gathering,

33:35.830 --> 33:36.830
then separating.

33:38.190 --> 33:39.460
I'm afraid.

33:41.430 --> 33:42.840
I'm afraid that one day,

33:45.550 --> 33:47.310
we will be blown apart

33:47.910 --> 33:49.120
and crushed.

33:53.750 --> 33:54.680
Don't be afraid.

33:55.710 --> 33:56.970
How can I not be afraid?

33:59.030 --> 34:00.490
I'm afraid of separation.

34:02.670 --> 34:04.930
I'm afraid when I wake up from this dream,

34:06.390 --> 34:09.650
there will only be a vast expanse of whiteness in the world.

34:15.350 --> 34:17.080
No matter how long the dream is,

34:18.000 --> 34:19.350
we will wake up.

34:20.230 --> 34:21.630
We'll go back to reality,

34:22.469 --> 34:24.600
but we'll remember the dream forever.

34:27.179 --> 34:28.310
So,

34:30.030 --> 34:30.989
don't be afraid.

34:35.310 --> 34:36.190
Right.

34:38.989 --> 34:43.120
You're the great demon dominating the two realms. With you protecting me,

34:45.190 --> 34:46.850
I have nothing to be afraid of.

34:51.949 --> 34:53.659
No wonder

34:54.000 --> 34:56.199
you forced me to sign the contract of lifelong protection.

34:56.199 --> 34:56.949
Yeah.

34:59.260 --> 35:01.350
I need a strong fighter.

35:08.590 --> 35:09.630
You

35:10.360 --> 35:12.550
are Baize Goddess now.

35:13.380 --> 35:15.980
Many great and little demons are watching you.

35:16.070 --> 35:17.870
You must live.

35:18.180 --> 35:19.940
They all rely

35:19.970 --> 35:22.170
on you to protect them.

35:25.030 --> 35:27.510
Why is it that every time I finish playing the wooden flute,

35:27.510 --> 35:28.420
my heart aches

35:28.550 --> 35:30.450
as if it's burning.

35:36.030 --> 35:36.580
Okay.

35:43.400 --> 35:45.260
Then let's live together.

35:57.470 --> 35:58.530
What are you doing?

36:01.510 --> 36:03.400
Since we agreed to live,

36:04.960 --> 36:06.040
let's seal it.

36:32.010 --> 36:33.460
I'll go find more livers.

36:33.600 --> 36:34.630
No need.

36:36.630 --> 36:39.720
Human livers can only slow down the spread of the poison.

36:39.720 --> 36:41.580
I'm already seriously poisoned.

36:43.560 --> 36:44.730
Don't bother.

36:56.550 --> 36:57.430
Don't worry.

36:59.310 --> 37:01.640
I will get the dragon scale to cure you.

37:35.860 --> 37:36.900
He's still angry.

37:42.290 --> 37:43.060
Zhuo,

37:43.080 --> 37:44.230
stop being angry.

37:44.700 --> 37:47.500
Next time, I'll act with you to fool Zhao Yuanzhou.

37:48.290 --> 37:49.910
There's no next time.

37:50.790 --> 37:52.920
I'm not good at pretending to quarrel,

37:53.690 --> 37:55.000
either.

37:57.240 --> 37:59.630
[One-Word Spell: act]

38:00.920 --> 38:02.040
Zhao Yuanzhou.

38:02.370 --> 38:03.630
Why is it not an option?

38:07.410 --> 38:08.050
Oh.

38:09.790 --> 38:11.050
Take the dragon scale.

38:11.060 --> 38:13.860
You can use it to repair your Cloud Light Sword now.

38:14.200 --> 38:15.330
There's no rush.

38:18.410 --> 38:20.070
This is the only dragon scale.

38:20.230 --> 38:22.830
Besides, we don't know how to repair the sword.

38:24.090 --> 38:26.230
I think we'd better wait for Lord Bai Yan

38:26.230 --> 38:27.310
to come back.

38:27.910 --> 38:28.900
Right.

38:29.350 --> 38:31.110
It's a matter of success and failure.

38:31.110 --> 38:32.110
We can't be hasty.

38:34.780 --> 38:36.200
For the time being,

38:36.420 --> 38:37.110
the dragon scale...

38:37.110 --> 38:37.910
Let me keep it.

38:46.030 --> 38:47.020
You?

38:48.090 --> 38:49.170
What?

38:50.630 --> 38:52.080
Your expression

38:51.950 --> 38:54.890
♫Leaving home, going far away from those mountains♫

38:52.190 --> 38:53.700
is very insulting.

38:54.980 --> 38:57.430
♫And that stream♫

38:55.890 --> 38:56.940
Don't worry.

38:57.350 --> 38:58.430
I'll keep it with me

38:57.810 --> 39:02.940
♫The boy wiped away his tears and sang♫

38:58.430 --> 38:59.710
and keep a close eye on it.

38:59.710 --> 39:01.840
Even if Mount Tai collapses in front of me,

39:01.840 --> 39:03.580
I won't even blink.

39:03.810 --> 39:06.640
♫He carried his dreams with him♫

39:05.150 --> 39:06.380
You're a Mountain God.

39:06.380 --> 39:07.620
Is it appropriate for you

39:06.740 --> 39:08.760
♫Jingling all the way♫

39:07.640 --> 39:08.960
to say "Mount Tai collapses"?

39:08.960 --> 39:11.060
♫Wind, rain, and light♫

39:10.570 --> 39:11.240
Okay.

39:11.110 --> 39:14.300
♫Wandering with me♫

39:11.630 --> 39:12.950
I can trust Ying Lei

39:12.970 --> 39:14.030
with the dragon scale.

39:14.030 --> 39:15.330
This is about Jiu.

39:15.430 --> 39:17.330
He'll put it ahead of himself.

39:15.490 --> 39:21.480
♫Standing somewhere high and walking into the crowd♫

39:21.790 --> 39:26.350
♫So what if I love the world more?♫

39:22.350 --> 39:23.150
Okay.

39:24.370 --> 39:25.280
But

39:26.420 --> 39:29.220
♫The more ordinary it is, the longer it lasts♫

39:27.550 --> 39:29.670
since Li Lun badly wants to stop us from repairing the sword,

39:29.260 --> 39:32.170
♫The moon is nodding with me♫

39:30.070 --> 39:32.220
he'll definitely come for the dragon scale.

39:32.220 --> 39:35.370
♫A person who falls asleep in a simple way is the gentlest♫

39:33.040 --> 39:35.080
Then I'll fight hard with him.

39:43.300 --> 39:44.080
Seal.

39:50.110 --> 39:51.310
To ensure its safety,

39:51.720 --> 39:53.580
I set a restriction with my power.

39:53.670 --> 39:54.930
No one can open the box.

39:55.710 --> 39:57.240
Then nothing will go wrong.

40:23.920 --> 40:24.860
Mr. Zhuo,

40:25.040 --> 40:25.970
why are you here?

40:27.820 --> 40:29.050
I'm worried.

40:29.980 --> 40:31.050
I'm afraid Li Lun

40:31.070 --> 40:32.870
will take away the dragon scale.

40:36.930 --> 40:38.330
The dragon scale is safe.

40:39.080 --> 40:40.740
I've been keeping an eye on it.

40:44.970 --> 40:46.130
Let me take a look.

40:48.430 --> 40:49.070
Sure.

41:04.830 --> 41:06.480
You're not Mr. Zhuo.

41:07.660 --> 41:09.310
You don't smell right.

41:09.760 --> 41:10.580
Oh?

41:12.420 --> 41:13.950
Then tell me

41:14.670 --> 41:16.070
what Mr. Zhuo

41:17.430 --> 41:18.670
smells like.

41:18.780 --> 41:19.830
Cut the crap!

41:21.070 --> 41:22.150
Ao Yin.

41:27.280 --> 41:28.080
Hey!

41:31.650 --> 41:35.350
[Ao Yin]

41:32.050 --> 41:32.850
Stop!

41:35.580 --> 41:37.300
Lord Bai Yan is back.

41:37.530 --> 41:38.860
Let's take the dragon scale to him now

41:38.860 --> 41:40.380
and ask him

41:40.470 --> 41:42.470
how to repair the Cloud Light Sword.

41:45.310 --> 41:46.310
Where is Ying Lei?

41:50.910 --> 41:52.520
[Ao Yin]

41:52.810 --> 41:54.180
It was Ao Yin again.

41:55.350 --> 41:57.150
The dragon scale was taken away.

41:57.270 --> 41:59.040
Looks like Ying Lei went after Ao Yin.

41:59.040 --> 42:00.050
Let's go save him

42:00.190 --> 42:01.850
and get the dragon scale back.

42:07.150 --> 42:07.950
Mr. Zhuo,

42:08.750 --> 42:09.810
what are you doing?

42:17.670 --> 42:18.900
Is he

42:19.400 --> 42:20.450
Ao Yin?

42:24.900 --> 42:26.320
He is not Ao Yin.

42:26.980 --> 42:28.460
He is Zhao Yuanzhou.

42:29.550 --> 42:31.480
But he's hiding something from us.

42:32.860 --> 42:34.200
Mr. Zhuo,

42:34.540 --> 42:35.640
what do you mean?

42:36.300 --> 42:38.960
Was the dragon scale really taken away by Ao Yin?

42:41.120 --> 42:43.510
[Ao Yin]

42:42.260 --> 42:43.960
The golden characters on the white wall

42:43.960 --> 42:45.470
are solid evidence.

42:48.510 --> 42:49.310
My lord,

42:50.210 --> 42:51.650
I got the dragon scale.

43:00.820 --> 43:01.790
I can't open it.

43:03.400 --> 43:04.200
Give it to me.

43:07.670 --> 43:08.800
I don't want the box.

43:10.090 --> 43:11.090
Give me your hand.

43:45.790 --> 43:46.790
My injury

43:47.880 --> 43:48.870
is not serious.

43:51.060 --> 43:53.260
You don't have much demonic power left.

43:53.880 --> 43:55.580
Don't waste it on me.

43:57.920 --> 44:00.820
I'm dying. My demonic power will be wasted

44:01.720 --> 44:03.000
if I still keep it.

44:05.990 --> 44:07.770
If I die,

44:09.880 --> 44:12.120
I'll give you all my demonic power.

44:38.010 --> 44:39.700
It's just a restriction.

44:41.140 --> 44:43.140
Looks like Zhao Yuanzhou

44:45.320 --> 44:47.000
has completely forgotten

44:48.480 --> 44:50.710
he once taught me

44:50.970 --> 44:52.190
all

44:53.900 --> 44:56.380
his tricks.

44:59.820 --> 45:00.900
My lord.

45:05.030 --> 45:06.630
You are seriously poisoned.

45:07.880 --> 45:10.010
Don't use your power lightly anymore.

45:22.530 --> 45:23.610
Where is the dragon scale?
